{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"c:@MLNTileSourceOptionAttributionHTMLString","symbolKind":"var","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNTileSourceOptionAttributionHTMLString","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Global Variable","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"title":"MLNTileSourceOptionAttributionHTMLString","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTileSourceOptionAttributionHTMLString"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An HTML string defining the buttons to be displayed in an action sheet when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source is part of a map view’s style and the map view’s attribution button is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pressed."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntilesourceoptionattributionhtmlstring"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"extern","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:MLNTileSource.h@T@MLNTileSourceOption","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOption","text":"MLNTileSourceOption","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MLNTileSourceOptionAttributionHTMLString","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default, no attribution statements are displayed. If the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionAttributionInfos","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" option is specified, this option is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored